Implementation verified on the Empyrean WaveView Tcl sandbox.

The `layout_routing_audit` proc is implemented in `./layout_routing_audit.tcl` and handles all the tricky semantics: case-insensitive status, last-wins dedup of duplicate nets, status inference from segments when absent, multi-layer-0-via missing-via detection, layer dedup/empty handling, the single-segment watchlist regardless of status, max_segments over non-skipped nets only with dictionary-order tie-breaks, numeric/string SUMMARY comparisons, and the FAIL > INCOMPLETE > PASS verdict priority.

Sandbox run output:
```
ALL_ASSERTS_PASS
RESULT:ALL_ASSERTS_PASS
DESIGN_FLOW_VERDICT=PASS
```

